4. one-particle CPT as a unitary U h(-k+Q) U^+ = -h(k), found on the term-free law; image of the added term
   Wilson-Dirac, b*gamma5                   Q=[0. 0. 0.] : CPT parity of term -1 (CPT-odd, forbidden) [dim 1]
   naive Weyl, t3 c1c2c3                    Q=[0. 0. 0.] : CPT parity of term -1 (CPT-odd, forbidden) [dim 1]
